{"id":"getcert-refresh-ca.1","n":"getcert-refresh-ca","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"certmonger","ver":"0.79.20-1.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/c/certmonger-0.79.20-1.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/getcert-refresh-ca.1.gz","sha256":"0c27fc4994f280c1cc31266d2afcdcdca88c223c46447ca5dd406388efaa1cae","date":"May 29, 2014","origin":"certmonger Manual"}},"nopt":{"r":2},"desc":"","r":[["NAME","<p>getcert</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p>getcert refresh-ca [options]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>Forces <i>certmonger</i> to refresh information specific to a CA, such as locally-stored copies of its certificates.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-c</b> <i>NAME</i>, <b>--ca</b>=<i>NAME</i></dt><dd>Refresh information about the CA which has the specified nickname.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-a</b>, <b>--all</b></dt><dd>Refresh information about all known CAs.</dd></dl>"],["BUGS","<p>Please file tickets for any that you find at https://fedorahosted.org/certmonger/</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>certmonger</b>(8) <b>getcert</b>(1) <b>getcert-add-ca</b>(1) <b>getcert-add-scep-ca</b>(1) <b>getcert-list-cas</b>(1) <b>getcert-list</b>(1) <b>getcert-modify-ca</b>(1) <b>getcert-refresh-ca</b>(1) <b>getcert-refresh</b>(1) <b>getcert-rekey</b>(1) <b>getcert-remove-ca</b>(1) <b>getcert-request</b>(1) <b>getcert-resubmit</b>(1) <b>getcert-start-tracking</b>(1) <b>getcert-status</b>(1) <b>getcert-stop-tracking</b>(1) <b>certmonger-certmaster-submit</b>(8) <b>certmonger-dogtag-ipa-renew-agent-submit</b>(8) <b>certmonger-dogtag-submit</b>(8) <b>certmonger-ipa-submit</b>(8) <b>certmonger-local-submit</b>(8) <b>certmonger-scep-submit</b>(8) <b>certmonger_selinux</b>(8)</p>"]]}